# Core Project Rules

## Context
- Base configuration for the LangGraph Agent project
- Applies to all files unless overridden by more specific rules

## Requirements
- Use Python best practices
- Follow minimalistic design principles
- Maintain clean code structure

## Package Management
- Always use `python -m pip` for package operations
- Keep dependencies minimal and versioned
- Use requirements.txt for dependency management

## Examples
<example>
# Good: Using python -m pip
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

# Good: Versioned dependencies
langchain-mcp-adapters==0.0.6
</example>

<example type="invalid">
# Bad: Direct pip usage
pip install package_name

# Bad: Unversioned dependencies
langchain-mcp-adapters
</example>
